{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/darvas-box-theory-limits"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>達瓦斯箱子理論怎麼看？3個限制比畫框重要｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"尼古拉·達瓦斯的公開自述裡，有一套後來被叫成箱子理論的做法：價格在區間裡來回，他當它在箱子裡；離開箱子才考慮動作。故事好講，因為箱子看得見。比較少被放進標題的是：他所處的市場深度、資訊速度與交易成本，都和今天的台股不同。看得見的框，最容易讓人忽略限制。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=stories\">人物與市場史</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 3 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">達瓦斯箱子理論怎麼看？3個限制比畫框重要</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">一、箱子本來在解決什麼</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">二、三個限制</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">三、為什麼畫框會變成定錨</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">四、能留的最小觀念</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">五、最小動作</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-6\">常見問題 FAQ</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-7\">總結</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-8\">延伸閱讀</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">尼古拉·達瓦斯的公開自述裡，有一套後來被叫成箱子理論的做法：價格在區間裡來回，他當它在箱子裡；離開箱子才考慮動作。故事好講，因為箱子看得見。比較少被放進標題的是：他所處的市場深度、資訊速度與交易成本，都和今天的台股不同。看得見的框，最容易讓人忽略限制。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\"><b class=\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\">本文重點</b><ul class=\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\"><li>箱子是對區間的假設，不是市場欠你的牆壁</li><li>突破在薄市場與演算法時代，假的比例不會比較低</li><li>畫框之前先問流動性與費用夠不夠付多次失敗</li></ul></div><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">一、箱子本來在解決什麼</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">公開敘述裡，他要處理的是：不要在沒有方向的來回裡一直動作。箱子是「先承認現在沒有方向」的視覺化。這層仍然有用。有用的是承認震盪，不是相信框會守住。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>箱子先承認沒方向</li><li>框不是牆壁</li><li>少動作是原意之一</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">二、三個限制</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">第一，資訊與撮合變快，大家都看得到的框，離開時更擠。第二，假突破是常態，不是例外，技術分析盲點與假突破兩篇寫過。第三，多次試錯的費用，在當沖稅費結構裡比他當年更咬人。</p><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>你以為的</th><th>限制</th><th>先怎麼辦</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>框會守住</td><td>框是假設</td><td>寫框破了怎麼辦</td></tr><tr><td>突破就真</td><td>假突破常見</td><td>要有失敗預算</td></tr><tr><td>畫得愈細愈準</td><td>愈細愈像事後</td><td>先用較粗的區間</td></tr><tr><td>當年有效所以現在有效</td><td>結構變了</td><td>只留「少在箱內動作」</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三、為什麼畫框會變成定錨</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">線一畫上去，大腦就想捍衛。定錨那篇講過成本價與前高；箱子是同一種黏法。框破了還在解釋「假破」，常常是在保護自己的筆，不是在讀市場。</p><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>畫框時同時寫作廢</li><li>破了先走規則</li><li>再決定要不要重畫</li></ol><figure class=\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\">✓沒方向少做✓框是假設✓先寫作廢</div><figcaption class=\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\">能留的</figcaption></figure></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">四、能留的最小觀念</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">能留的是：沒方向時少動作。不能留的是：某一種畫法保證比較準。觀念很小，但違反「我一定要做點什麼」的衝動。</p><ul class=\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\"><li>沒方向就少做</li><li>畫法不是保證</li><li>衝動才是敵人</li></ul></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">五、最小動作</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">若你現在有一個框，旁邊寫：這是假設、假破預算是幾次、流動性夠不夠你離開。三行寫不完，就先不要把框當成計畫。</p></section><section id=\"sec-6\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">常見問題 FAQ</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\"><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>箱子理論過時了嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">畫法會過時。「沒方向少動作」比較不過時。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>突破要不要等確認？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">等確認會錯過，不等會吃假突破。這是權衡，不是密技能消掉的。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>日線箱子和分線箱子能共用嗎？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">週期不同，框的意義不同。共用口訣是常見誤用。</p></details><details class=\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\"><summary>和支撐壓力差在哪？</summary><p class=\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\">都很易變成要捍衛的線。先寫失效，再談名字。</p></details></div></section><section id=\"sec-7\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">總結</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">達瓦斯箱子的原意包含少在沒方向時動作。框不是牆壁。假突破、擁擠與費用是三個限制。先寫作廢再畫。</p></section><section id=\"sec-8\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">延伸閱讀</h2><ul class=\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\"><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/why-breakout-trades-often-fail\">假突破</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/support-resistance-how-to-draw\">支撐壓力</a></li><li><a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/anchoring-bias-in-trading\">定錨效應</a></li></ul></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/why-breakout-trades-often-fail\">假突破</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/support-resistance-how-to-draw\">支撐壓力</a><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/anchoring-bias-in-trading\">定錨效應</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\